<title>HONG KONG: New Taipei Fund places up to 24 mln shares.</title>
<headline>New Taipei Fund places up to 24 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Taipei Fund Ltd said on Tuesday it had arranged to place up to 24 million shares with independent professional investors at a price to be based on the net asset value per share.</p>
<p>The proceeds of the placement, to be carried out September 3-27, will be reinvested.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
